   const MOUSE_SENSITIVITY = 0.3

   var movement_direction = Vector3()
   var camera = null
   var mouse_direction = Vector3()

   onready var keyboard = $Keyboard
   ```

   Use the `get_viewport().get_mouse_position()` function to get the mouse position in screen space, and use the `unproject_position()` method to convert it to world space. This can be used as the looked-at point to rotate the camera, as follows:

   ```
